# rpi-kernel_7.2, toolchain llvm
### LLVM_IAS=1: the assembler of clang. With the one of binutils (LLVM_IAS=0) clang writes the assembly
### of an intrinsic into a file the assembler then reads without the architecture extension the function
### asked for, and lib/crc/crc64-neon.c stops the build ("selected processor does not support pmull").
### The integrated assembler is what the kernel expects from clang, and its default since 5.15
PKG_MAKEVARS=LLVM_IAS=1
